---
description: Review UI for the three ui-break-cases layout bugs and emit a Playwright test. Use when looking at CSS overflow, clipped labels, or a fixed footer covering a control.
alwaysApply: false
---

Read `skill/SKILL.md` and the matching `skill/cases/<id>.md` before changing layout or writing a Playwright test for these patterns.

- Confirm with geometry: bounding boxes, `Range.getClientRects`, `elementFromPoint` before click.
- Tolerances: 4px slack, 16px defect (`skill/lib/geometry.ts`). No uncommented magic numbers.
- If the page resembles a **control** (local scroll, painted expand button, spacer under a fixed bar), report no bug.
- Fixes must keep the copy and keep the control usable.
- Copy `skill/templates/<id>.spec.ts` and `skill/lib/geometry.ts`. Set `TARGET.url`. The generated test must fail on broken via `expect` and pass on fixed.
- Chromium only. Human review required. See `docs/agent-skill.md`.
